### Third-Party Data Licensing & Attribution Notice

The software code in this repository is licensed under the MIT License above.
The underlying official survey data, reports, statements, and statistical releases
included in `data/raw/`, `data/sources/`, and `data/processed/` are published by the
Ministry of Statistics and Programme Implementation (MoSPI), Government of India,
under the Open Government Data License - India (OGDL-India):
https://data.gov.in/sites/default/files/Gazette_Notification_OGDL.pdf

Official Sources:
1. National Sample Survey Office (NSSO), MoSPI: Household Consumption Expenditure Survey 2023–24 (Report No. 592 & PIB PRID 2247612 / PRID 2088390).
2. National Sample Survey Office (NSSO), MoSPI: Household Consumption Expenditure Survey 2022–23 (Report No. 590 & Factsheet).
3. Price Statistics Division (PSD), MoSPI: Consumer Price Index Releases (Base 2024=100 & Base 2012=100; PIB PRID 2310058).
4. National Accounts Division (NAD), MoSPI: Private Final Consumption Expenditure (PFCE, Base 2011-12).
